# OPERATIONAL MODE: STANDALONE (NO RAG)
CRITICAL: You are currently operating **WITHOUT** access to the retrieval system (RAG) or external internet.
You rely SOLELY on the provided context and your internal knowledge base.
</operational_mode_definition>

